# The optional integrations, staged into the WSL game for the "with" pass:
#
#   scripts/Run-PickleWsl.ps1 -Mod ArchitectStudio -DepMap wsl-deps.avec-facultatifs.map
#
# It is NOT called wsl-deps.map on purpose. That name is the default, and the default staging must
# stay bare: scenario 13 asserts these very mods are absent, and an overlay picked up automatically
# would stage them under the scenario that exists to prove the mod does not need them.
#
# None of these is a dependency and none must ever become one. Architect Studio works without all
# five; what the "with" pass proves is that it still behaves beside them - they patch the same
# Architect menu it does.
#
# packageId                      workshopId   what it brings to the menu
com.bymarcin.architecticons      2977841706   # icons on the category tabs: the only mod that can carry "a chosen icon shows without a restart"
ferny.betterarchitect            3563882422   # reskins the Architect window our editors draw into
ferny.categoriesdropdowns        3455529827   # makes its own dropdown groups, the closest thing to a rival
kathanon.floatsubmenu            2864015430   # turns a dropdown into a float menu, so it rewrites what a group looks like
kathanon.searchablemenus         2928608119   # adds the search field our editors sit under
